{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>去台灣旅遊又有必買收藏品！台灣全新推出「Chiikawa 御守悠遊卡」，將Chiikawa與神社御守完美結合，簡直係粉絲出門必備嘅專屬隨身護身符！今次悠遊卡特別做成超精緻嘅日系御守造型！卡面集結咗Chiikawa、小八同兔兔，配上御守設計，最可愛是御守上竟然有他們三個的自畫像公仔，超級可愛！平時去台灣搭捷運、坐台鐵或者去便利店買嘢，拎呢張卡出嚟嘟一嘟都心情大好！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179130243931577765_2602523696ac51b2813a44.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179130244160440324_10878586776ac51b2a98e09.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179130244547422125_3610799346ac51b2e79b95.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179130244874012867_3343051496ac51b311f42f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179130245046933075_14281098716ac51b3449bf4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T16:04:01.246211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}